  "description": "Due to this park being within a conservation area it will be designed sympathetically using natural materials and natural play. Alot of environmental work will also be undertaken to improve the site ecologically creating new habitats and managing the existing trees and shrubs.\nThe play facility is also designed to be natural in appearance made of timber and is designed for a younger age group meaning a low chance of any noise disturbance, the play facilities will include a bespoke beaver multiunit and activity trail together with tradtional timber play items such as a multi swing, roundabout and springers.",
